    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Instructions to follow below steps :-\n\n## With Image Workflow\n\nThis n8n flow starts when a form with an image is submitted:\n1. The image is converted into Base64.\n2. Sent to Google’s **Gemini 2.5 Flash Image** (Nano-Banana) API via HTTP.\n3. The API returns the edited image, which is converted back into a usable file.\n\nWith the API, handling advanced image editing becomes simple—you just send a request and get back a ready result.\n\n---\n\n## Without Image Workflow\n\nThis lightweight version skips file handling. Trigger manually, send a text prompt directly to Nano-Banana API, and instantly receive the generated output.\n\nPerfect for quick prototyping and testing prompts.",
        "height": 528,
        "width": 624,
        "color": 4
      },
